--- !u!114 &1506570689
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1506570688}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 80b82827bca367d4aaf1869e90e64b72, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textComponent: {fileID: 563346662}
  lines:
  - '*Happy Dwende humming an infectious tune*'
  - 'Steve: *Hums along*'
  - 'Happy Dwende: Oh, hey there! You like this song too? I heard it for the first
    time just now, and immediately fell in love with it!'
  - 'Manny: It''s very catchy! Where did you hear it?'
  - 'Happy Dwende: It sounded like it came from over the mountains to the SOUTHEAST.
    When I caught the tune, I saw a giant snake-like tail going up and over the cliff
    - that might be the creature that made this catchy tune.'
  - "Steve: A snake that makes a catchy tune\u2026 Interesting."
  - "Happy Dwende: \u2026"
  - 'Happy Dwende: Actually, would you guys mind doing me a favor?'
  - 'Steve: What can we do to help?'
  - 'Steve: What can we do to help?'
  - 'Happy Dwende: A while back, I was testing out the new tune that I heard on my
    beloved flute. But suddenly, I got ambushed by a pack of kapres and they stole
    my flute! '
  - 'Happy Dwende: Then they ran away somewhere in the woods around the mountains
    to the NORTHEAST. Please, you have to get it back for me! Steve: Gotcha! Let''s
    go get it, Manny! '
  linesRepeat:
  - '*Steve and Manny walk up to the Happy Dwende, tired and beaten from all the
    kapres they had to go through to get the flute*'
  - 'Manny: *sighs* We barely made it out of those woods!'
  - 'Steve: I can''t believe it took that much work to get a stupid flute!'
  - 'Happy Dwende: YAYYY!! You got it! You got it!! Give it here!'
  - 'Steve: Woah! Not so fast!'
  - 'Manny: Yeah! We clawed our way through an enclave of kapres to get that - why
    did they want to protect this flute so much?'
  - 'Happy Dwende: Well uh, maybe they, maybe they REALLY liked the design of the
    flute?'
  - "Steve and Manny: \u2026"
  - 'Steve and Manny: The design?'
  - 'Steve: So what is this wonderful design it has?'
  - "Nervous Dwende: \u2026It\u2019s blue?"
  - "Steve and Manny: \u2026"
  - 'Steve: We''re not giving you the flute.'
  - "Nervous Dwende: WAIT WAIT NO! Uhhh\u2026 fine! I lied about the flute."
  - 'Desperate Dwende: The kapres keep it safe because it has mystical properties
    that allow any tune played on it to PUT CREATURES TO SLEEP. '
  - 'Desperate Dwende: That''s really all I know! Please give me the flute, I need
    it to SUBDUE the creature!'
  - "Lovestruck Dwende: That tune mesmerized me\u2026 I knew right then and there
    that I needed to hear it every single day!"
  - "Lovestruck Dwende: If I captured the creature for myself, then whenever I wanted,
    I\u2019d be able to hear that blissful melody! *sighs*"
  - "Manny: Hey, Steve... I think that flute is too dangerous to let loose. Even
    moreso in this guy\u2019s hands\u2026 The kapres were guarding it for a good
    reason."
  - 'Steve: Heh, funny. I was just thinking the same thing.'
  - 'Steve: I''m sorry, we can''t give you the flute.'
  - 'Manny: Hey, if it helps - we can play the tune for you on this flute.'
  - 'Angry Dwende: NOOOOOOOO! You''ll pay for this!!'
  - '*The now-Angry Dwende scurries away while throwing a fit*'
  linesRepeat2:
  - "Happy Dwende: If I can get that flute\u2026 oh! You're still here... please
    go get the flute back! *Hums happily*"
  currentLines: []
  textInterval: 0.03
  pointer: {fileID: 1969180324}
  clueImage: {fileID: 83707107}
  LSSDwende: {fileID: 144975417}
  HUD: {fileID: 0}
